{"id":145101373,"slug":"trouble-sleeping-is-driving-obesity","title":"Trouble Sleeping is Driving Obesity","subtitle":"A small but troubling tale","post_date":"2024-05-30T12:42:59.672Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/trouble-sleeping-is-driving-obesity","wordcount":812,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:52:53.901Z","body_sha256":"69a88663e6232428fe7949b364417125a68b8335995fe337c8dc837b882b1073","text_words":971,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>As a psychiatrist, people talk to me about their sleep…often.  They want something to help.  You can even buy over-the-counter sleep aids!  Usually, these are antihistamines.  They must be safe!  They are over the counter! </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Define…<em>safe?</em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg\" width=\"900\" height=\"1200\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1200,&quot;width&quot;:900,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:214882,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!G8WM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffc9687d5-7630-4959-bf00-a9de5016fc42_900x1200.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Usually, we think of acute safety—will this drug kill me now?  And even though enough antihistamines will plausibly kill you, the lethal dose is quite high.  And add TikTok Challenges, and you get <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/safety/medical-product-safety-information/benadryl-diphenhydramine-drug-safety-communication-serious-problems-high-doses-allergy-medicine\">FDA warnings:</a></p><blockquote><p>FDA is warning that taking higher than recommended doses of the common over-the-counter (OTC) allergy medicine Benadryl (diphenhydramine) can lead to serious heart problems, seizures, coma, or even death. FDA is aware of news reports of teenagers ending up in emergency rooms or dying after participating in the “Benadryl Challenge” encouraged in videos posted on the social media application TikTok.</p><p>FDA is investigating these reports and conducting a review to determine if additional cases have been reported.</p></blockquote><p>However, there are slower ways to die, and the most important is the slide from obesity to metabolic syndrome to diabetes to end-stage organ damage to dialysis to death.  Today, I’ll point out that “trouble sleeping” is a problem that leads to obesity.</p><p>The 2005–2006 National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES) trial <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/steel-cut-oats?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">has appeared in prior writing of mine, </a>but today, we will look at what this data tells us about antihistamines<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a>.</p><blockquote><p><strong>Prescription h1 antihistamine use</strong></p><p><strong>268</strong> adults (174 females and 94 males) reported use of an H1 antihistamine and completed all outcome measure components. </p><p>599 age- and gender-matched controls (401 females and 198 males) were used as a comparison for body meas- urements, plasma glucose, insulin concentrations, and lipid levels.</p></blockquote><p>Antihistamine use (which is very commonly used as a sleep aid) is correlated strongly with weight gain and insulin changes:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic\" width=\"340\" height=\"348.30957230142565\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1006,&quot;width&quot;:982,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:340,&quot;bytes&quot;:107789,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pjYM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F03532266-73a4-434a-9a91-4e3fd75c8ab7.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Ok, so that is very significant…but it’s not randomized, and it's retrospective, not prospective.  It could be that the underlying sleep problem is the driver of both the weight changes and the prescription of the antihistamines.  Adults are messy—surely, children treated with antihistamines don’t have the same catastrophic weight gain!  Oh, wait<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a>…they do:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic\" width=\"516\" height=\"445.76666666666665\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1244,&quot;width&quot;:1440,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:516,&quot;bytes&quot;:141058,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5xQ_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff065134f-f17f-46d2-82de-44f3e59e4227.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Yes, if they are Hispanic youth, as studied in the above paper, they do.  We have male participants getting, on average, 0.44 Standard Deviations more BMI  and girls gaining 0.13 Standard Deviations.  That is effect size, folks; <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/the-muir-skee-lo-emotionally-corrective?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">you’ve seen it before</a> in this newsletter.  That translates to an <strong>11.42% BMI increase per year…in children—in whom it’s harder to blame it on a desk job.</strong></p><p>Delving into the trials of antihistamines, I had to look into the data submitted to the <a href=\"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/nda/98/040140.PDF\">FDA to get this data on diphenhydramine</a>. (No, that is the injectable form!). Here <a href=\"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2022/205352Orig1s016lbl.pdf\">we go, the oral form! </a>(No, that is just the package insert!).  Finding strong randomized data in the time frame in which I knocked out of this daily article was impossible. The bottom line is these medicines were approved based on short-term data; thus, phase IV data is almost inherently less likely to be randomized data, and <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/whence-placebo-controlled-trials?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">we need other study designs to make sense of it!</a></p><p>Short sleep duration on its own is related to obesity in a variety of study designs<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-3\" href=\"#footnote-3\" target=\"_self\">3</a>.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic\" width=\"438\" height=\"342.0370879120879\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1137,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:438,&quot;bytes&quot;:272977,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o8DP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb1f484f9-de34-4a9d-aaa4-f06f52475935.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>And we know from hit articles like <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/bad-sleep-1?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">“Bad Sleep:: -1”</a> that poor sleep is a killer both here and now (especially considering nightmares)…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic\" width=\"310\" height=\"310\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1200,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:310,&quot;bytes&quot;:63533,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fOZw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcc57748e-8ca9-4979-9197-f02fbf8e7ae5.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Less sleep alone leads to weight gain and increased food eating (“energy intake”)<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-4\" href=\"#footnote-4\" target=\"_self\">4</a>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic\" width=\"302\" height=\"353.2192\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1462,&quot;width&quot;:1250,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:302,&quot;bytes&quot;:47049,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_pnd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F87a327aa-1a7e-45bc-8548-97d51592e1f4.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>We have a bit of a bind… too little sleep will kill you, either through obesity or suicide, and make your <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/if-you-have-adhd-these-three-problems?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">ADHD worse in the meantime.</a>  Further, even not-antihistamine drugs like <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/ambien?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">Ambien will also kill you.</a>  What will help you sleep better?!?!</p><p>It’s not about drugs, usually.  We had Pear’s <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/requiem-for-a-the-tragedy-of-the?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">Somyrst</a>, but market forces blew that up.  We still have CBT-I, and the<a href=\"https://mobile.va.gov/app/cbt-i-coach\"> free VA CBT-i Coach app is a good place to start.</a></p><p>If a person has PTSD, there are an effective treatment—Prazosin— for their disrupted sleep, including, as recently highlighted by my friend <a href=\"https://www.thecarlatreport.com/authors/258-chris-aiken-md\">Chris Aiken, M.D.</a>: </p><blockquote><p>99 RCTs with <strong>10,481</strong> participants were included. <strong>Prazosin</strong> may be the most effective treatment for insomnia (SMD = -0.88) nightmares (SMD = -0.44) and poor sleep quality (SMD = -0.55). Evidence is scarce and indicates lack of efficacy for SSRIs, Mirtazapine, z-drugs and benzodiazepines, which are widely used in daily practice. Risperidone and Quetiapine carry a high risk of causing somnolence without having a clear therapeutic benefit.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-5\" href=\"#footnote-5\" target=\"_self\">5</a></p></blockquote><p>I would also be remiss not to mention the <a href=\"https://nightware.com\">Nightware</a> device, a non-pharmacologic medical device for Nightmare disorder. </p><blockquote><p>The components of greatest improvement were Sleep Latency (<em>P</em> = .018, d = 0.71) and Sleep Disturbances (<em>P</em> = .030, d = 0.66).<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-6\" href=\"#footnote-6\" target=\"_self\">6</a></p></blockquote><p>Let’s take sleep seriously, and the obesity poor sleep—and risky sleep medicines— can drive.  Oral antihistamines are a risky option for long-term insomnia, and short-term use often leads to long-term use.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>Ratliff, J. C., Barber, J. A., Palmese, L. B., Reutenauer, E. L., &amp; Tek, C. (2010). Association of prescription H1 antihistamine use with obesity: results from the National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey. <em>Obesity</em>, <em>18</em>(12), 2398-2400.</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>Saad, M., Syed, S., Ilyas, M., &amp; Gashev, A. A. (2020). Antihistamines increase body mass index percentiles and Z-scores in Hispanic children. <em>Children</em>, <em>7</em>(12), 305.</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-3\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-3\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">3</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>Patel, S. R., &amp; Hu, F. B. (2008). Short Sleep Duration and Weight Gain: A Systematic Review. <em>Obesity</em>, <em>16</em>(3), 643-653. https://doi.org/10.1038/oby.2007.118</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-4\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-4\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">4</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>Chaput, J. P., &amp; Tremblay, A. (2012). Insufficient sleep as a contributor to weight gain: an update. <em>Current obesity reports</em>, <em>1</em>, 245-256.</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-5\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-5\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">5</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>Lappas AS, Glarou E, Polyzopoulou ZA, Goss G, Huhn M, Samara MT, Christodoulou NG. Pharmacotherapy for sleep disturbances in post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD): A network meta-analysis. Sleep Med. 2024 May 20;119:467-479. doi: 10.1016/j.sleep.2024.05.032. Epub ahead of print. PMID: 38795401.</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-6\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-6\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">6</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5664/jcsm.10338\">https://doi.org/10.5664/jcsm.10338</a></p><p></p></div></div>","text":"As a psychiatrist, people talk to me about their sleep…often. They want something to help. You can even buy over-the-counter sleep aids! Usually, these are antihistamines. They must be safe! They are over the counter!\n\nSubscribe now\n\nDefine… safe?\n\nUsually, we think of acute safety—will this drug kill me now? And even though enough antihistamines will plausibly kill you, the lethal dose is quite high. And add TikTok Challenges, and you get FDA warnings:\n\nFDA is warning that taking higher than recommended doses of the common over-the-counter (OTC) allergy medicine Benadryl (diphenhydramine) can lead to serious heart problems, seizures, coma, or even death. FDA is aware of news reports of teenagers ending up in emergency rooms or dying after participating in the “Benadryl Challenge” encouraged in videos posted on the social media application TikTok.\n\nFDA is investigating these reports and conducting a review to determine if additional cases have been reported.\n\nHowever, there are slower ways to die, and the most important is the slide from obesity to metabolic syndrome to diabetes to end-stage organ damage to dialysis to death. Today, I’ll point out that “trouble sleeping” is a problem that leads to obesity.\n\nThe 2005–2006 National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES) trial has appeared in prior writing of mine, but today, we will look at what this data tells us about antihistamines 1 .\n\nPrescription h1 antihistamine use\n\n268 adults (174 females and 94 males) reported use of an H1 antihistamine and completed all outcome measure components.\n\n599 age- and gender-matched controls (401 females and 198 males) were used as a comparison for body meas- urements, plasma glucose, insulin concentrations, and lipid levels.\n\nAntihistamine use (which is very commonly used as a sleep aid) is correlated strongly with weight gain and insulin changes:\n\nOk, so that is very significant…but it’s not randomized, and it's retrospective, not prospective. It could be that the underlying sleep problem is the driver of both the weight changes and the prescription of the antihistamines. Adults are messy—surely, children treated with antihistamines don’t have the same catastrophic weight gain! Oh, wait 2 …they do:\n\nYes, if they are Hispanic youth, as studied in the above paper, they do. We have male participants getting, on average, 0.44 Standard Deviations more BMI and girls gaining 0.13 Standard Deviations. That is effect size, folks; you’ve seen it before in this newsletter. That translates to an 11.42% BMI increase per year…in children—in whom it’s harder to blame it on a desk job.\n\nDelving into the trials of antihistamines, I had to look into the data submitted to the FDA to get this data on diphenhydramine . (No, that is the injectable form!). Here we go, the oral form! (No, that is just the package insert!). Finding strong randomized data in the time frame in which I knocked out of this daily article was impossible. The bottom line is these medicines were approved based on short-term data; thus, phase IV data is almost inherently less likely to be randomized data, and we need other study designs to make sense of it!\n\nShort sleep duration on its own is related to obesity in a variety of study designs 3 .\n\nAnd we know from hit articles like “Bad Sleep:: -1” that poor sleep is a killer both here and now (especially considering nightmares)…\n\nLess sleep alone leads to weight gain and increased food eating (“energy intake”) 4 :\n\nWe have a bit of a bind… too little sleep will kill you, either through obesity or suicide, and make your ADHD worse in the meantime. Further, even not-antihistamine drugs like Ambien will also kill you. What will help you sleep better?!?!\n\nIt’s not about drugs, usually. We had Pear’s Somyrst , but market forces blew that up. We still have CBT-I, and the free VA CBT-i Coach app is a good place to start.\n\nIf a person has PTSD, there are an effective treatment—Prazosin— for their disrupted sleep, including, as recently highlighted by my friend Chris Aiken, M.D. :\n\n99 RCTs with 10,481 participants were included. Prazosin may be the most effective treatment for insomnia (SMD = -0.88) nightmares (SMD = -0.44) and poor sleep quality (SMD = -0.55). Evidence is scarce and indicates lack of efficacy for SSRIs, Mirtazapine, z-drugs and benzodiazepines, which are widely used in daily practice. Risperidone and Quetiapine carry a high risk of causing somnolence without having a clear therapeutic benefit. 5\n\nI would also be remiss not to mention the Nightware device, a non-pharmacologic medical device for Nightmare disorder.\n\nThe components of greatest improvement were Sleep Latency ( P = .018, d = 0.71) and Sleep Disturbances ( P = .030, d = 0.66). 6\n\nLet’s take sleep seriously, and the obesity poor sleep—and risky sleep medicines— can drive. Oral antihistamines are a risky option for long-term insomnia, and short-term use often leads to long-term use.\n\nSubscribe now\n\n1 Ratliff, J. C., Barber, J. A., Palmese, L. B., Reutenauer, E. L., & Tek, C. (2010). Association of prescription H1 antihistamine use with obesity: results from the National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey. Obesity , 18 (12), 2398-2400.\n\n2 Saad, M., Syed, S., Ilyas, M., & Gashev, A. A. (2020). Antihistamines increase body mass index percentiles and Z-scores in Hispanic children. Children , 7 (12), 305.\n\n3 Patel, S. R., & Hu, F. B. (2008). Short Sleep Duration and Weight Gain: A Systematic Review. Obesity , 16 (3), 643-653. https://doi.org/10.1038/oby.2007.118\n\n4 Chaput, J. P., & Tremblay, A. (2012). Insufficient sleep as a contributor to weight gain: an update. Current obesity reports , 1 , 245-256.\n\n5 Lappas AS, Glarou E, Polyzopoulou ZA, Goss G, Huhn M, Samara MT, Christodoulou NG. Pharmacotherapy for sleep disturbances in post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD): A network meta-analysis. Sleep Med. 2024 May 20;119:467-479. doi: 10.1016/j.sleep.2024.05.032. Epub ahead of print. PMID: 38795401.\n\n6 https://doi.org/10.5664/jcsm.10338"}